Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 19:05:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] ws: SD card, 4G signal and camera push setting

Core: HddInfoList (102), PushTask (219/218), Net3g4gInfo (255, sent by
4G cameras unrequested every few seconds while connected) and
next_net_3g4g_info(); the payload debug print names the message id.

ws state: storage (total/free GB, formatted, mounted), push_enabled,
signal_level/signal_value/mobile_operator (followed passively while
connected); command push {on}.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
